            "review_title": "Review at Tiem Com Ga Hai Nam",
            "review_text": "BorntocruiseUK\nHeathfield, United Kingdom15226 contributions\n0\nGreat portion size and so fresh and tasty\nOct 2024 • Couples\nWe visited on a couple of occasions and I’ve never looked at the reviews. Not sure why there are no excellent ratings. \n\nThe food we ate was probably the best in our month long travel across Vietnam. \n\nThe food is served quickly and it’s very hot. We tried several different dishes and we were not disappointed at all. \n\nPortions are a good size and offer great value for money. \n\nGive it a try\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2024",
