            "review_text": "Allan M\nPerth, Australia69 contributions\n0\nGood value and tasty\nOct 2019 • Couples\nFound this place by accident. Was busy but lucky to find out they had an upstairs. \nPlenty choice on the menu and looks good value for money. I had the Malaysian fried rice whisky my Vietnamese girlfriend had the roast chicken and rice. My fried rice was so tasty and helped with some chicken stolen from my GF's plate 😉. Her chicken and rice was basic but nice. I had a nice cold sprite. Total was 121,000 dong which is about $7.80 AUS. I'd give it 3.5 out of 5. Worth a visit. \nJust one thing I'd tell the owner and staff. Try to smile a bit more. No one looks very happy in their workplace or maybe it's just because I caught them on a bad day 😂.\nRead more\nWritten October 28, 2019",
