            "review_text": "Myan\nLos Angeles, California28 contributions\n0\nGreat for a quick dinner!\nDec 2018 • Family\nWe stayed at an airbnb at the Ben Thanh Tower nearby and was within walking distance. This review is completely for the food and not service because you can’t count on excellent service in Vietnam. It’s a different way of life. \n\nMy family and I ordered the regular Hainan Chicken and Rice. Rice was amazingly flavorful, and the chicken was delicious and tender. Portion size was small, but perfect for me. Meat was not plentiful, but was not disappointing. We did end up ordering extra chicken separately. If you’re gluttonous and expect a huge portion, don’t come here. For two bucks, I’d rather pay for cleanliness than eating street food. I ordered two portions to-go for my boyfriend, one duck and one chicken. Will be back on my next visit!\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2018",
