            "review_text": "needlehill\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam454 contributions\n0\nDecent food at cheap prices\nJul 2017 • Couples\nIf you want a dish of rice with chicken or xa xiu pork for 40k, that's a good place.\nYou can have one more portion if you're still hungry.\nI would recommend the food coming from the street side instead of the food coming from the kitchen though. Stick to simple dishes. The rest is not so good and fresh.\nQuite crowded for dinner.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 12, 2017",
