            "review_text": "Joe_K_US\nU.S.91 contributions\n0\nReally good roasted chicken and rice\nJun 2016 • Solo\nFor the price you can't beat it. 40,000 dong for some rice with some super good tender roast chicken on top. The chicken cannot be better. Ate this dish several times. Iced tea or cold canned beer quite inexpensive too. Just watch out for the soup. I had some on my second visit. It tasted good, but after a few minutes I felt this burning tingling on my back and neck. This is from them putting a ton of msg in it. Had to drink a couple bottles of water and I was ok in a couple hours. Next time I stuck to the chicken. Also sautéed spinach was quite good (about 40,000 dong).\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2016",
